00:01:39.103 --> 00:01:58.288
<v Ananya Desai>So the big addition since the PR is the ACL model. Every source object, a Slack channel, a Gmail thread, a WhatsApp chat, gets an access list. When we sync, we pull the members. And every message, entity mention, fact and commitment links back to the source objects it came from.</v>

