<v Rohan Kulkarni>Tricky how?</v>

21
00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:40.334
<v Ananya Desai>Because the fact itself might only make sense with the private message. Like the price was mentioned in public but the discount was in a DM. For now I'm doing the strict version. If you can't see every supporting row, the derived row is filtered by the ones you can see.</v>

